# A mine lantern on a timber post: an arm reaching right with a braced corner, the lantern on an
# iron hook, an iron band round the post and rocks wedged at its foot. Cave style, so the light
# comes from the top right: right edges lighter, left edges and undersides darker.
# Two states: lit, and out (the same lantern with dark glass).
sprite lantern_post
size 16 32
style cave
anchor 5 31

frame lit
  ................
  ................
  ................
  ...VVvv.........
  ...vvvvvvvvvvv..
  ...wwwVVVVVVVV..
  ...WWwwwwV..J...
  ...wwVvwV...i...
  ...wwVvV...iJi..
  ...wwVv...iiJJj.
  ...wwVv...IYyYj.
  ...wWVv...IyqYj.
  ...wWVv...IYyYj.
  ...wwVv...IoYoj.
  ...wwVv...iiiJj.
  ...wwVv....iiJ..
  ...wwwv.........
  ...wwwv.........
  ...wwVv.........
  ...iiJj.........
  ...WWWw.........
  ...wwVv.........
  ...wWVv.........
  ...wWVv.........
  ...wwVv.........
  ...wwwv.........
  ...wwwv.........
  ...wwVvZz.......
  .xZwwVvxZz......
  .XxWwVvXxx......
  ................
  ................
end

# Out: the glass goes dark, with a dull reflection where the flame was.
frame out from lit recolor Y>i y>J q>i o>I

outline
shadow 10 3
